sequenceDiagram
    participant Stab as Stabilizer
    participant Member as LocalRingMember
    participant Client as GrpcRingClient
    participant Bootstrap as Bootstrap /orchestrator_ring.Ring
    participant Succ as Successor /orchestrator_ring.Ring

    Note over Stab,Bootstrap: 1. Join Ring via Bootstrap Node
    Stab->>Client: find_successor(bootstrap_addr, self_node.id)
    Client->>Bootstrap: FindSuccessor(FindSuccRequest { id })
    Bootstrap-->>Client: NodeInfo (successor)
    Client-->>Stab: NodeInfo (succ)
    Stab->>Member: set_successor(succ)

    Note over Stab,Succ: 2. Periodic Stabilization (stabilize)
    Stab->>Client: get_predecessor(succ.address)
    Client->>Succ: GetPredecessor(Empty)
    Succ-->>Client: OptionalNodeInfo { node: Option<x> }
    Client-->>Stab: Option<NodeInfo> x

    alt x is Some and in_open(self.id, succ.id, x.id)
        Stab->>Member: set_successor(x)
        Stab->>Client: notify(x.address, self_node)
        Client->>Succ: Notify(NotifyRequest { other: self_node })
        Succ-->>Client: BoolMsg { ok }
    else x is not closer
        Stab->>Client: notify(succ.address, self_node)
        Client->>Succ: Notify(NotifyRequest { other: self_node })
        Succ-->>Client: BoolMsg { ok }
    end

    Note over Stab,Succ: 3. Successor List Refresh (refresh_successor_list)
    Stab->>Client: get_successor_list(succ.address)
    Client->>Succ: GetSuccessorList(Empty)
    Succ-->>Client: NodeInfoList { nodes }
    Client-->>Stab: Vec<NodeInfo>
    Stab->>Member: set_successor_list([succ, ...nodes])
